OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FThree people who were convicted of
OL,7,Fmanslaughter in a trial where a TikTok
OL,8,Finfluencer was jailed for murder have
OL,9,Flost their bids to challenge their
OL,10,Fconvictions.
OL,12,FSaqib Hussain and Mohammed Hashim
OL,13,FIjazuddin were killed in February
OL,14,F2022, with TikTok influencer Mahek
OL,15,FBukhari and her mother Ansreen Bukhari
OL,16,Fjailed for their murders.
OL,18,FThe two men were ambushed and then
OL,19,Fdied during a high-speed car chase.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FAs well as the mother and daughter,
OL,7,FRekhan Karwan, Raees Jamal, Ameer
OL,8,FJamal, Sanaf Gulammustafa and Natasha
OL,9,FAkhtar were in one of two vehicles
OL,10,Fthat was chasing Mr Hussain and Mr
OL,11,FIjazuddin's car.
OL,13,FAt a hearing earlier this month, Ameer
OL,14,FJamal, Gulammustafa and Akhtar brought
OL,15,Fappeals against their manslaughter
OL,16,Fconvictions to the Court of Appeal in
OL,17,FLondon.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FJudges were told that each of the
OL,7,Fthree admitted to being a passenger in
OL,8,Fthe car but denied being part of any
OL,9,Fplan to harm Mr Hussain and were
OL,10,Funaware that their car would ram Mr
OL,11,FHussain's.
OL,13,FLawyers for the trio argued that while
OL,14,Fthey were convicted of unlawful act
OL,15,Fmanslaughter ` which requires an
OL,16,Funlawful action to take place which
OL,17,Fcaused death ` the trial judge had not
OL,18,Fidentified this "base" offense in the
OL,19,Fquestions jurors had to consider.
OL,26,@zD@QOUzD@VO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FHowever, three judges dismissed their
OL,7,Fappeals in a ruling on Tuesday.
OL,9,FWhat happened in the case ?
OL,11,FThe trial at Leicester Crown Court
OL,12,Fheard that the two men's murders
OL,13,Ffollowed Ansreen's unsuccessful
OL,14,Fattempts to break off her affair with
OL,15,FMr Hussain.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FJurors heard that Mr Hussain had
OL,7,Fthreatened to release sexually
OL,8,Fexplicit material he had of Ansreen if
OL,9,Fshe did not pay him the #3,000 he
OL,10,Fclaimed to have spent on her during
OL,11,Ftheir tryst.
OL,13,FProsecutors claimed Mr Hussain and Mr
OL,14,FIjazuddin, both 21 and from Banbury in
OL,15,FOxfordshire, were "lured" to "one last
OL,16,Fmeeting" with the Bukharis in a Tesco
OL,17,Fcar park in Hamilton in Leicester,
OL,18,Funder the pretence of returning the
OL,19,Fmoney.
OL,26,@wD@SOUwD@YO]wD@^OUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FBut the trial heard that the Bukharis
OL,7,Fand others ambushed the pair, chasing
OL,8,FMr Ijazuddin's Skoda along the A46 in
OL,9,FLeicester in two vehicles and
OL,10,Fdeliberately ramming them off the road.
OL,12,FGulamustafa, Jamal and Akhtar had all
OL,13,Fbeen passengers in the two cars that
OL,14,Fpursued Mr Hussain and Mr Ijazuddin
OL,15,Ffrom Leicester up the A46, before it
OL,16,Fwas rammed off the road into the
OL,17,Fcentral reservation.
OL,19,FIt then burst into flames, killing
OL,20,Fboth young men.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FIn their ruling, Lord Justice Jeremy
OL,7,FBaker, sitting with Mr Justice Bryan
OL,8,Fand Judge Simon Hirst, said: "We
OL,9,Fconsider that in the context of this
OL,10,Fcase, where there was no question but
OL,11,Fthat those involved in the plan were
OL,12,Fintent on inflicting unlawful violence
OL,13,Fupon Saquib Hussain, these questions
OL,14,Fappropriately set out the matters
OL,15,Fwhich the jury had to consider.
OL,26,@pD@^OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,F"The jury would have been well aware
OL,7,Fthat the common plan which was being
OL,8,Freferred to was the plan to attack
OL,9,FSaqib Hussain when he arrived at
OL,10,FTesco's car park, in order to kill
OL,11,Fhim, or to cause him to suffer either
OL,12,Freally serious bodily harm, or some
OL,13,Flesser degree of harm."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@WO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FAfter a successful Court of Appeal
OL,7,Fchallenge over their sentences last
OL,8,Fyear, Ameer Jamal was sentenced to 12
OL,9,Fyears and eight months in prison,
OL,10,FGulamustafa given a sentence of 12
OL,11,Fyears and nine months and Akhtar was
OL,12,Fhanded nine years and eight months in
OL,13,Fprison.
OL,15,FMahek Bukhari was originally given a
OL,16,Flife sentence with a minimum term of
OL,17,F31 years and eight months, but the
OL,18,FCourt of Appeal reduced the minimum
OL,19,Fterm to 26 years and 285 days during
OL,20,Fthe same challenge.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/10
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1785422895
OL,3,CTrio jailed in trial of TikToker lose
OL,4,Cmanslaughter appeal
OL,6,FRekhan Karwan and Raees Jamal were
OL,7,Fjailed for life with a minimum of 26
OL,8,Fyears and 10 months and 31 years
OL,9,Frespectively for two counts of murder,
OL,10,Fwhile Ansreen Bukhari was given a life
OL,11,Fsentence with a minimum term of 26
OL,12,Fyears and nine months.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/10
